    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d760">

                <pb facs="1007" n="893" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg893"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.42157Sa29/788</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Press Release Issued by the Department of State,
                        October 7, 1931</hi><anchor n="*" xml:id="d760-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1931-10-07">October 7, 1931</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>Negotiations between the Governments of the United States and Canada looking to
                    the framing of a treaty for the development of the St. Lawrence seaway will be
                    initiated at once. The Canadian Government has expressed the opinion that in the
                    initial stages of the negotiations progress would more definitely be assured by
                    direct and verbal exchange of views between the two Governments and President
                    Hoover has agreed to this procedure.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d760-f1" n="*" type="source" xml:id="d760-f1-content">
                <p>This identical statement is being given out simultaneously at Ottawa. [Note in
                    the original.]</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
